{"obsah":"<p>On the first weekend of May we had a double exhibition at the Bike Blessing in Dolní Branná, where we rode two shows on a newly built playground near the local church. Together with Martin Šimůnek we prepared a workshop with an obstacle course for the local kids, and despite the initial rain quite a lot of locals and visitors came.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Straight from Dolní Branná we headed for Most, where two bikers were getting married at the Rudolice farmstead. Dad's a cyclist and the kids ride trails and bike parks. A few guests were slightly tipsy, but most were saving themselves for our surprise, arranged by the bride's mother. All the best in life to the newlyweds and to the wedding guests who lay down under our wheels 🙂</p>\n\n<p>The following weekend safety was on the agenda in front of a shopping centre in Teplice. This big event, attended by practically all organisations focused on safety and the rescue services, has an almost 20-year tradition, and you could tell from the turnout. Events at shopping centres are usually a bit boring, but a decent number of people came here and the organisation was high quality too. So Martin Šimůnek and Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček rode slightly sharper and longer shows. The first had light rain at the end, but the second was spot on.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F05%2F20230513_161709.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F05%2F20230513_161709.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237279\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F05%2F20230513_162128.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F05%2F20230513_162128.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237278\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F05%2F20230513_162206.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F05%2F20230513_162206.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237276\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F05%2FDSC09137.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F05%2FDSC09137.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237277\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F05%2FDSC09148.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F05%2FDSC09148.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237280\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F05%2FDSC09151.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F05%2FDSC09151.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237281\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2